            "title": "Path Traversal vulnerability in readTenantFile",
            "severity": "critical",
            "problem": "The `readTenantFile` function joins `tenantRoot` and `requestedPath` using `path.resolve` without sanitizing or validating the `requestedPath`. This allows a malicious `requestedPath` to escape the `tenantRoot` directory (e.g., using `../`), leading to arbitrary file access outside the intended tenant directory.",
